        "feedback": {
          "grade": "Correct",
          "result": "Correct",
          "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=15$ into the expression for $p(x)$ and simplify: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p(x) & =a{x}^{2}+bx \\\\ p(15) & =a(15)^{2}+b(15) \\\\  & =225a+15b.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $p(15)=225a+15b.$",
